{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22311","headline":"权摄昭应早秋书事寄元拾遗兼呈李司录 · 白居易","name":"权摄昭应早秋书事寄元拾遗兼呈李司录","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"夏闰秋候早，七月风骚骚。\n渭川烟景晚，骊山宫殿高。\n丹殿子司谏，赤县我徒劳。\n相去半日程，不得同游遨。\n到官来十日，览镜生二毛。\n可怜趋走吏，尘土满青袍。\n邮传拥两驿，簿书堆六曹。\n爲问纲纪掾，何必使铅刀。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22311.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22311","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}